  "details": {
   "description": "Elevate your skincare routine with Spinz DeTan Face Pack — a powerful blend of Besan, Honey, Kojic Acid, Arbutin, and Fruit Extracts specially designed for sun-tanned skin.\nThis unique formula gently exfoliates dead skin cells and brightens your complexion, unveiling a salon-like glow right at home.\nSun exposure can leave your skin dull, tanned, and uneven. Spinz DeTan Face Pack is your go-to solution to restore your skin’s natural radiance. Enriched with the goodness of Besan, Honey, and Kojic Acid, this effective yet gentle formula helps reduce sun-induced tan while promoting a brighter, more even-toned complexion.\nBesan, a time-honored skincare staple, gently exfoliates and removes impurities for a fresh, luminous look.\nHoney provides deep hydration and soothes the skin, leaving it soft and supple.\nKojic Acid, known for reducing pigmentation, helps enhance skin clarity and glow.\nUnlike harsh chemical treatments, Spinz DeTan Face Pack is free from bleach, sulphates, and peroxides, making it safe for regular use and suitable for all skin types.\nWhether you need a quick pre-event glow or an effortless weekly skin revival, Spinz DeTan Face Pack helps you achieve visibly brighter, even-toned, radiant skin with ease.\"",
   "usageInstructions": "DIRECTIONS FOR USE:\n1. Wash your face / neck.\n2. Apply a thick layer of Spinz Detan on tanned face / neck & leave it for 15 minutes.\n3. Gently massage in circular motions.\n4. Wipe off with a wet cloth or rinse with water.",
